{"id":"peu","lemma":"peu","pos":"adv","rank":85,"glosses":["little, not much","a little (un peu)"],"ipa":"/pø/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/aa/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Penegal-peu.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Penegal-peu.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Viens un peu plus près.","en":"Come a little closer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103093","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"near, close"}]},{"text":"Donne-moi un peu de temps.","en":"Give me a little time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102735","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Peux-tu parler de ça un peu ?","en":"Can you talk about that a little?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334660","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to speak, talk"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Pouvez-vous attendre un peu ?","en":"Can you wait a bit?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to wait for, to await"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je connais un peu de français.","en":"I know a little French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/472311","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"French"}]}]}